WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 9=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:41.580 --> 01:45.940
(Ten Thousand Volumes Library)

01:47.799 --> 01:48.920
Where is Scholar Shouyi?

01:49.256 --> 01:50.920
Old Master said
he wanted to look around.

01:51.159 --> 01:51.959
I'll go get him.

01:52.319 --> 01:52.680
No need.

01:53.464 --> 01:54.392
I'll find him myself.

02:25.240 --> 02:26.039
Scholar Shouyi.

02:56.120 --> 02:57.199
The Zhongfu Hexagram.

02:58.520 --> 02:59.800
The second yang line.

03:17.080 --> 03:18.280
Very good.

03:18.479 --> 03:19.879
Taken from heaven and earth,

03:20.120 --> 03:21.599
and returned to heaven and earth.

03:22.520 --> 03:23.280
Sir,

03:23.352 --> 03:24.776
what does this hexagram mean?

03:25.520 --> 03:28.479
A gentleman stays within his home.

03:29.240 --> 03:30.520
When he speaks,

03:31.319 --> 03:34.639
if his words are good, they will
find accord a thousand miles away,

03:34.840 --> 03:37.400
let alone nearby.

03:37.919 --> 03:39.199
He stays within his home.

03:39.199 --> 03:40.360
When he speaks,

03:41.439 --> 03:45.560
if his words are unkind, they will
meet opposition a thousand miles away,

03:46.039 --> 03:48.639
let alone nearby.

03:49.199 --> 03:50.479
I don't understand.

03:52.319 --> 03:53.280
Sir,

03:53.360 --> 03:54.840
what does that mean?

03:55.199 --> 03:56.759
When you're at home

03:57.599 --> 03:58.840
and say kind things,

03:59.000 --> 04:01.840
even people a thousand
miles away will respond in kind,

04:02.000 --> 04:03.599
let alone those nearby.

04:05.319 --> 04:06.319
When you're at home

04:06.319 --> 04:08.000
and say unkind things,

04:08.400 --> 04:10.400
even people a thousand
miles away will oppose you,

04:10.520 --> 04:11.879
let alone those nearby.

04:13.400 --> 04:14.960
I still don't understand.

04:19.040 --> 04:20.160
Good girl.

04:20.439 --> 04:22.079
Say you know when you know,

04:22.079 --> 04:23.959
and say you don't when you don't.

04:24.839 --> 04:25.639
Good.

04:28.360 --> 04:29.560
My young friend,

04:31.360 --> 04:32.519
do you understand now?

04:34.920 --> 04:36.360
Be careful with your words.

04:36.519 --> 04:37.800
Say more kind things

04:37.800 --> 04:38.839
and build goodwill.

04:38.839 --> 04:40.160
Don't speak carelessly,

04:40.279 --> 04:42.000
or you'll face the consequences.

04:43.040 --> 04:43.920
I understand.

04:44.800 --> 04:46.800
Who taught you

04:46.879 --> 04:48.839
yarrow-stalk divination?

04:50.720 --> 04:52.360
I was often ill as a child.

04:52.439 --> 04:53.759
When I stayed at a nunnery,

04:53.760 --> 04:56.260
I watched the master perform divinations
and learned a little.

04:56.480 --> 04:58.639
Unfortunately, I only learned
how to cast a hexagram,

04:58.759 --> 04:59.879
not how to interpret one.

05:09.639 --> 05:10.480
Fengtai.

05:16.920 --> 05:17.680
Young Master.

05:17.959 --> 05:19.000
I came across

05:19.279 --> 05:22.639
two young friends trying
their hand at yarrow-stalk divination.

05:25.120 --> 05:29.160
Grass, old, and sun

05:30.319 --> 05:32.519
together form
the character for "yarrow".

05:32.920 --> 05:34.160
It piqued my interest,

05:34.399 --> 05:37.959
so I asked them to divine

05:38.360 --> 05:39.360
the matter at hand.

05:41.240 --> 05:43.920
Old Master Lin runs his household well.

05:44.360 --> 05:47.519
Even the maids here
are quite perceptive.

05:49.439 --> 05:50.639
You flatter us, Scholar Shouyi.

05:52.800 --> 05:54.000
The banquet is about to begin.

05:55.040 --> 05:55.839
Let's go.

06:02.800 --> 06:03.920
My young friends,

06:04.959 --> 06:08.360
if you ever come to Qixia Mountain,

06:08.750 --> 06:11.272
(Qixia Academy, Fang Yu)
bring my calling card

06:11.280 --> 06:12.800
and come find me at Qixia Academy.

06:14.680 --> 06:15.879
Thank you, sir.

06:32.360 --> 06:33.560
Why are you here?

06:35.120 --> 06:37.040
Young Madam wanted to look around

06:37.240 --> 06:38.800
and told us to wait for her here.

06:40.008 --> 06:41.830
Young Madam sent me
back to get her shoes.

06:42.040 --> 06:43.959
I couldn't find them, so I hurried back.

06:44.160 --> 06:46.759
Xiaolian said Young Madam
told us to wait here,

06:46.959 --> 06:49.040
so Xiaolian and I practiced
yarrow-stalk divination

06:49.120 --> 06:50.360
while waiting for Young Madam.

06:59.144 --> 07:00.856
There's no need
to wait for Young Madam.

07:01.519 --> 07:02.639
Go find First Madam

07:03.240 --> 07:04.480
and follow her instructions.

07:06.240 --> 07:06.879
Yes.

07:18.980 --> 07:21.380
♪See the long road winding on♪

07:21.380 --> 07:23.860
♪As all the noise falls silent♪

07:24.220 --> 07:29.300
♪The keepsake rests against my chest
as I wait with lowered eyes♪

07:29.700 --> 07:32.140
♪See how the passing years wear away♪

07:32.140 --> 07:34.700
♪As even deep affection fades♪

07:36.020 --> 07:40.380
♪The past is like fallen leaves
scattered into dust♪

07:48.519 --> 07:49.279
Fengtai.

07:57.959 --> 07:58.759
Lanxiang.

07:59.519 --> 08:00.480
How did you know

08:00.639 --> 08:02.879
Scholar Fang would join us
in yarrow-stalk divination?

08:04.340 --> 08:09.700
♪The wind scatters the clouds,
the rain turns to mud♪

08:10.456 --> 08:12.504
(For great matters,
use tortoise divination.)

08:12.510 --> 08:14.392
(For small matters,
use yarrow divination.)

08:15.439 --> 08:17.160
(Tortoise shells are used to divine,)

08:17.656 --> 08:19.720
(while yarrow stalks
are used to cast hexagrams.)

08:20.120 --> 08:23.000
These yarrow stalks
are firm yet flexible.

08:23.000 --> 08:26.000
In a thousand years,
they grow three hundred stalks.

08:26.759 --> 08:28.000
Their roots have grown old,

08:28.856 --> 08:30.744
so they are said
to tell good fortune from bad.

08:45.679 --> 08:46.879
You little rascal.

08:48.000 --> 08:50.440
Fang Shouyi begged me to teach him,

08:50.440 --> 08:51.679
but I never did.

08:52.679 --> 08:54.399
Yet you fell asleep listening to me.

08:58.360 --> 09:00.960
All divination
has its roots in the Book of Changes.

09:01.759 --> 09:04.840
I thought I'd teach you the basics,

09:05.112 --> 09:06.680
so the next time you returned home,

09:06.760 --> 09:08.440
you could play yarrow-stalk divination

09:08.440 --> 09:09.799
with your friends.

09:11.039 --> 09:12.720
You'd beat them every time.

09:14.720 --> 09:16.759
But instead, you're dozing off.

09:17.720 --> 09:18.480
Grandfather,

09:18.759 --> 09:19.440
I'll learn.

09:20.279 --> 09:21.039
Really?

09:27.039 --> 09:27.679
(These are)

09:27.960 --> 09:29.000
(fifty yarrow stalks.)

09:29.000 --> 09:31.100
♪See how the passing years wear away♪

09:31.100 --> 09:33.180
♪As even deep affection fades♪

09:34.639 --> 09:36.720
When I used to
deliver meals to Rongbao Pavilion,

09:37.440 --> 09:39.600
I once heard some scholar mention

09:40.840 --> 09:43.039
that Scholar Fang was devoted
to the Book of Changes.

09:43.440 --> 09:45.864
He especially admired
King Wen of Zhou and Confucius,

09:45.870 --> 09:48.000
who were both
skilled in yarrow-stalk divination.

09:48.519 --> 09:50.080
I saw some yarrow by the vat,

09:50.320 --> 09:51.799
so I thought I had nothing to lose

09:51.928 --> 09:54.024
and pulled out
some dried stalks to give it a try.

09:59.440 --> 10:00.760
Bodhisattva, please bless us.

10:02.840 --> 10:04.039
Bodhisattva, please bless us.

10:28.424 --> 10:30.120
Lucao, who was
slacking off in the kitchen,

10:30.120 --> 10:31.159
has already been tied up.

10:31.559 --> 10:33.720
We'll trade her to merchants
from the north for furs.

10:34.296 --> 10:37.096
But there are still two maids
who have been staying with my sister,

10:37.159 --> 10:40.000
Xu Lanxiang and Du Xiaolian.

10:40.600 --> 10:41.759
Those two maids

10:42.799 --> 10:44.799
have already caught
Fang Shouyi's attention,

10:46.120 --> 10:47.639
and he even gave them his calling card.

10:48.720 --> 10:51.559
It's already become
a favorite story at the banquet.

10:53.000 --> 10:54.799
If they suddenly disappeared,

10:55.120 --> 10:56.399
wouldn't word of it

10:56.519 --> 10:59.200
draw even more attention?

11:00.639 --> 11:03.559
But what if
they find out about my sister...

11:03.799 --> 11:04.639
Idiot.

11:06.399 --> 11:10.600
Lin Jinqi has killed people
with his own hands.

11:10.600 --> 11:12.159
He's far more ruthless than you.

11:12.759 --> 11:15.000
If those two maids notice anything,

11:15.519 --> 11:18.519
Lin Jinqi will deal
with them sooner or later.

11:18.799 --> 11:20.240
Why dirty our own hands?

11:23.519 --> 11:24.639
You're right, Father.

11:26.519 --> 11:28.039
We lost a son-in-law today,

11:28.639 --> 11:30.639
but gained Fang Shouyi's help.

11:31.960 --> 11:34.000
At least we'll have something

11:34.000 --> 11:35.448
to tell Old Master in the capital.

11:36.000 --> 11:39.240
Now we still have
Qian Shaoze to deal with.

11:44.799 --> 11:45.519
Master.

11:45.679 --> 11:47.759
Qian... Qian Shaoze escaped.

11:50.279 --> 11:50.960
Useless.

11:51.000 --> 11:52.856
You couldn't even
keep watch over one man!

11:56.480 --> 11:59.000
We can't exactly report this
to the authorities now.

11:59.279 --> 12:00.120
Good that he escaped.

12:02.759 --> 12:05.080
After all, he holds the rank
of a scholar.

12:05.120 --> 12:07.000
It would've been rather inconvenient

12:08.080 --> 12:09.639
to deal with him inside the residence.

12:10.240 --> 12:12.360
Then, Father, you mean...

12:14.240 --> 12:15.600
Even if he's running away,

12:15.679 --> 12:17.960
is he supposed to run away on foot?

12:19.960 --> 12:21.919
A carriage, a horse, or a boat...

12:22.559 --> 12:23.960
Which one doesn't cost money?

12:27.200 --> 12:28.399
I'll go find my sister.

12:28.679 --> 12:29.720
She must know

12:29.799 --> 12:31.240
where Qian Shaoze keeps his money.

13:04.320 --> 13:04.840
Hyah!

13:40.000 --> 13:41.240
If you want to live,

13:41.639 --> 13:43.639
hand over all your money.

13:44.879 --> 13:45.600
Sirs...

13:47.639 --> 13:48.480
Sirs...

13:48.799 --> 13:50.000
I'll give you all my money.

13:50.328 --> 13:51.550
I only ask that you show mercy.

13:51.559 --> 13:52.799
Please spare my life.

14:02.080 --> 14:03.279
Young Master Qian,

14:04.000 --> 14:06.120
you've been
making usurious loans for years.

14:06.360 --> 14:08.080
How could this be all you have?

14:11.440 --> 14:12.279
Who are you?

14:12.679 --> 14:13.519
Who are you?

14:14.279 --> 14:14.919
Who are you?

14:15.240 --> 14:15.919
Who are you?

14:33.200 --> 14:33.559
I'll...

14:33.759 --> 14:35.200
I'll give you the money.

14:35.799 --> 14:36.320
Here.

14:36.480 --> 14:37.559
Please spare my life.

15:25.399 --> 15:26.799
Just as you said,

15:27.279 --> 15:28.879
we had men watch outside the bank,

15:29.240 --> 15:30.919
and sure enough, Qian Shaoze showed up

15:30.919 --> 15:33.120
in disguise to exchange
his money for silver.

15:33.360 --> 15:35.160
We followed him
all the way out of the city

15:35.399 --> 15:37.200
until we found a deserted mountain road.

15:37.480 --> 15:39.000
Only then did we get our chance.

15:41.279 --> 15:43.360
It's exactly 4,000 taels, not one short.

15:43.960 --> 15:45.639
Now that you're back home,

15:46.088 --> 15:48.264
you don't have anywhere
to spend money anyway.

15:49.480 --> 15:50.399
So this money...

15:51.159 --> 15:52.519
I'll keep it safe for you for now.

15:55.144 --> 15:56.200
We had an agreement.

15:57.120 --> 15:58.960
I told you how to catch Qian Shaoze.

16:00.240 --> 16:01.559
You get Qian Shaoze,

16:02.952 --> 16:03.944
and I get the money.

16:08.120 --> 16:08.840
Yes.

16:09.919 --> 16:11.440
I'm only keeping it safe for you.

16:11.759 --> 16:13.519
I never said I'd take your silver.

16:13.840 --> 16:15.240
Why are you acting like this?

16:16.559 --> 16:17.360
You'd better not.

16:26.399 --> 16:26.879
Master.

16:28.180 --> 16:29.660
(Separation Agreement)

16:30.080 --> 16:32.440
You shameless wretch.

16:33.159 --> 16:34.600
You've utterly disgraced

16:34.879 --> 16:36.519
this entire family.

16:39.224 --> 16:40.610
This is your separation agreement.

16:40.799 --> 16:41.799
Keep it safe.

16:47.399 --> 16:48.279
What about my dowry

16:48.559 --> 16:50.080
and the silver in my room?

16:50.120 --> 16:50.919
You wretch!

16:50.919 --> 16:51.720
Master!

16:52.360 --> 16:53.960
Old Master Lin already said

16:54.320 --> 16:55.960
your dowry
and everything in Zhichun Hall

16:56.080 --> 16:58.720
that wasn't purchased
with the Lin family's common funds,

16:58.799 --> 17:00.200
whether people or possessions,

17:00.200 --> 17:02.536
will all be returned
with you to the Zhao family.

17:04.000 --> 17:04.839
You wretch!

17:04.839 --> 17:05.400
Move.

17:05.400 --> 17:05.799
Master.

17:05.799 --> 17:06.440
Move!

17:08.599 --> 17:09.920
Because of your scandal,

17:10.480 --> 17:12.559
we've been running around all day,

17:13.839 --> 17:15.160
smiling and bowing,

17:15.480 --> 17:19.240
doing everything
we could to cover it up.

17:19.759 --> 17:21.000
Now that we're back,

17:21.440 --> 17:24.640
you don't even ask whether
we're hungry, tired, or cold.

17:24.680 --> 17:27.119
All you talk about is money!

17:30.359 --> 17:31.240
If I asked,

17:32.240 --> 17:34.119
wouldn't you still
think I've disgraced you?

17:40.232 --> 17:42.184
You want to marry me off
as soon as possible?

17:43.160 --> 17:47.079
To some old man who could benefit you,

17:49.200 --> 17:50.519
so I can be his second wife?

17:50.559 --> 17:52.400
I'll beat you to death, you wretch!

17:52.759 --> 17:54.559
Calm down, Master.

17:54.599 --> 17:55.240
Master!

17:55.240 --> 17:56.640
I'll beat you to death!

17:57.480 --> 17:58.400
In this world,

17:59.944 --> 18:01.960
men who speak sweetly
but harbor cruel intentions,

18:03.000 --> 18:05.079
and parents who keep
saying it's for my own good,

18:06.664 --> 18:07.920
as far as I'm concerned,

18:08.400 --> 18:10.319
aren't as dependable
as cold, hard silver

18:11.680 --> 18:12.680
that can't even speak.

18:12.690 --> 18:13.599
I'll beat you to death!

18:13.599 --> 18:14.839
Master, take care of yourself.

18:14.839 --> 18:15.680
You wretch!

18:15.880 --> 18:17.160
My sister is talking nonsense.

18:17.160 --> 18:17.799
Besides,

18:17.799 --> 18:19.319
why would you lower yourself

18:19.319 --> 18:20.359
to argue with a woman?

18:20.359 --> 18:22.359
Xingtang, apologize to Father at once!

18:25.200 --> 18:26.519
You useless woman!

18:27.240 --> 18:27.799
Look at her!

18:27.880 --> 18:29.000
Look how badly you've

18:29.000 --> 18:30.359
spoiled this wretch!

18:30.480 --> 18:31.960
Master, please calm down.

18:43.480 --> 18:44.680
Let me tell you this.

18:45.799 --> 18:47.640
I'm your father.

18:48.640 --> 18:51.799
I gave you life,

18:52.359 --> 18:53.720
and I raised you.

18:54.839 --> 18:56.079
Never mind your silver

18:56.119 --> 18:57.400
and your dowry.

18:57.559 --> 18:58.720
Even you

18:58.920 --> 19:00.400
belong to the Zhao family.

19:00.799 --> 19:03.319
Only what the Zhao family
chooses to give you

19:04.039 --> 19:05.599
is truly yours.

19:06.680 --> 19:08.440
Never mind your silver.

19:09.039 --> 19:11.160
Even if I beat you to death today,

19:11.720 --> 19:15.039
the world would only
call you disobedient and unfilial.

19:17.400 --> 19:18.079
Go.

19:18.640 --> 19:19.599
Take her silver

19:20.200 --> 19:21.039
and her dowry

19:21.448 --> 19:23.144
and put them into the family estate.

19:23.240 --> 19:23.960
Store them away.

19:40.200 --> 19:41.000
Master.

19:42.279 --> 19:43.079
Master!

19:45.240 --> 19:48.480
The Three Obediences and Four Virtues
have always bound me,

19:50.000 --> 19:51.160
and I have no power to resist.

19:51.839 --> 19:52.920
But today...

19:54.759 --> 19:55.559
Master,

19:58.400 --> 19:59.200
either

20:00.200 --> 20:01.759
you beat this unfilial daughter of yours

20:02.440 --> 20:04.039
to death right here

20:04.559 --> 20:07.000
and take back the life
you and First Madam gave me,

20:10.519 --> 20:11.160
or...

20:13.960 --> 20:15.319
My dowry

20:16.119 --> 20:17.400
and my silver

20:18.920 --> 20:20.240
must be returned in full!

20:27.240 --> 20:28.279
Otherwise,

20:30.319 --> 20:32.240
as long as I still draw breath,

20:36.680 --> 20:38.119
I'll tell everyone.

20:38.319 --> 20:39.400
Everyone!

20:42.119 --> 20:44.160
I'll tell them why
Grand Secretary Zhao's

20:45.784 --> 20:47.550
eldest granddaughter
cannot have children,

20:51.240 --> 20:54.720
and why the Zhao
and Lin families agreed to a separation!

21:01.279 --> 21:02.599
Didn't you tell me

21:05.519 --> 21:06.960
that we must stand together as one?

21:10.504 --> 21:12.240
That when one prospers, we all prosper,

21:14.200 --> 21:15.640
and when one suffers, we all suffer?

21:20.599 --> 21:22.240
If I have to suffer,

21:23.440 --> 21:25.000
then no one

21:25.624 --> 21:27.544
in the Zhao family
will have an easy life.

21:48.880 --> 21:49.799
You've gone mad.

21:51.160 --> 21:52.119
Madwoman.

21:53.960 --> 21:55.839
You're a madwoman.

21:59.440 --> 22:00.640
And let me tell you this.

22:02.240 --> 22:03.920
If it weren't for Old Master,

22:05.640 --> 22:06.400
today,

22:07.440 --> 22:09.279
I'd kill you with my own hands.

22:25.480 --> 22:26.559
Please calm down.

22:42.279 --> 22:43.039
Careful.

22:56.728 --> 22:58.200
Everything here has been inventoried.

22:58.200 --> 22:59.272
You can move it out now.

23:09.480 --> 23:11.224
These were brought from the Zhao family

23:11.230 --> 23:12.970
by the eldest daughter
of the Zhao family.

23:13.032 --> 23:15.510
They'll now be returned
to the Zhao family with her dowry.

23:16.079 --> 23:16.559
Yes.

23:20.360 --> 23:22.920
These were purchased by
the eldest daughter of the Zhao family

23:22.920 --> 23:24.559
with the family's common funds.

23:24.920 --> 23:26.279
They'll now be sold,

23:26.280 --> 23:28.520
and the proceeds
will go back into the common funds.

23:29.240 --> 23:30.759
Two of you, move these out.

23:39.784 --> 23:40.920
Is that about everything?

23:41.119 --> 23:41.960
Pretty much.

24:15.880 --> 24:17.000
What should we do?

24:21.519 --> 24:22.680
Let's clean up.

24:24.079 --> 24:25.400
Whether we stay or leave,

24:26.312 --> 24:28.160
there's no harm
in keeping everything clean.

24:29.519 --> 24:30.640
Lanxiang is right.

24:31.680 --> 24:33.160
Instead of waiting around anxiously,

24:33.912 --> 24:35.400
we might as well find something to do.

24:37.528 --> 24:38.728
I'll fetch some water.

25:11.848 --> 25:12.680
The water is cold.

25:12.880 --> 25:13.759
I'll do the washing.

25:37.799 --> 25:38.599
Baogai,

25:39.279 --> 25:40.519
when we worked in the tea room,

25:41.000 --> 25:42.480
you looked after me very well.

25:43.519 --> 25:44.519
I don't remember

25:45.079 --> 25:46.039
anything else.

25:52.720 --> 25:54.599
We were all just trying to survive.

26:02.280 --> 26:03.270
Let's do this together.

26:05.240 --> 26:05.920
All right.

26:10.559 --> 26:11.440
I'll use this cloth.

26:12.700 --> 26:17.980
♪Through rise and fall, people meet
and part as they always do♪

26:22.079 --> 26:22.759
I'll wipe this.

26:23.079 --> 26:23.880
You wipe here.

26:23.880 --> 26:24.400
All right.

26:24.780 --> 26:27.780
♪Flowers drift with the ties of fate♪

26:27.780 --> 26:31.060
♪Plum blossoms bloom,
enduring the frost♪

26:31.060 --> 26:36.780
♪Yet their proud spirit
fades with wind and snow♪

26:36.780 --> 26:40.020
♪Bamboo shadows
embrace quiet contentment♪

26:40.020 --> 26:43.140
♪Only orchids dwell in secluded places♪

26:43.540 --> 26:49.020
♪Watching the old
and new take turns in this world♪

26:53.319 --> 26:53.960
Here.

26:54.319 --> 26:55.880
First Madam, watch your step.

27:22.640 --> 27:23.839
First Madam is here.

27:31.944 --> 27:33.384
- First Madam.
- First Madam.

27:49.039 --> 27:49.960
Gantang

27:52.240 --> 27:53.720
will be promoted to second-class maid.

27:59.200 --> 28:00.319
Thank you, First Madam.

28:02.279 --> 28:05.480
Together with Xiaolian,
Lanxiang, and Baogai,

28:06.119 --> 28:07.720
that makes four second-class maids.

28:09.480 --> 28:11.319
Add eight more third-class maids.

28:13.039 --> 28:14.720
Have Madam Han come help,

28:15.319 --> 28:16.759
and assign a cook

28:16.839 --> 28:18.920
and a few honest women
for the heavy chores.

28:19.839 --> 28:20.880
That should be enough staff

28:21.319 --> 28:22.680
for Zhichun Hall.

28:23.370 --> 28:25.500
But finding a first-class maid
who can manage things

28:25.519 --> 28:27.759
and is both loyal and dependable

28:28.160 --> 28:29.839
won't be easy

28:30.319 --> 28:31.799
on such short notice.

28:32.720 --> 28:34.319
Jinqi has already made arrangements.

28:35.279 --> 28:38.599
That boy always thinks ahead.

28:38.880 --> 28:40.440
As his mother,

28:40.799 --> 28:43.519
I'm both relieved and concerned for him.

28:44.119 --> 28:45.519
Young Master is simply being filial.

28:46.079 --> 28:48.160
You have nothing
to worry about, First Madam.

28:49.400 --> 28:50.319
First Madam.

28:50.880 --> 28:51.759
She's here.

29:09.640 --> 29:10.319
First Madam.

29:10.319 --> 29:12.780
(Yuchan)

29:14.279 --> 29:15.240
First Madam just said

29:15.250 --> 29:17.990
Young Master had already arranged
for someone to manage Zhichun Hall.

29:18.000 --> 29:20.440
I was wondering who it could be

29:20.680 --> 29:22.880
that both Young Master
and First Madam could trust.

29:23.759 --> 29:25.119
So it's Yuchan.

29:26.632 --> 29:28.790
Thank you, First Madam,
for making an exception for me.

29:29.400 --> 29:30.160
Only then

29:30.680 --> 29:32.000
was I able to come back.

29:33.960 --> 29:35.119
Now that you're back,

29:35.640 --> 29:36.920
manage this courtyard well

29:37.559 --> 29:38.880
and serve Young Master properly.

29:42.680 --> 29:44.559
I will do my utmost

29:44.880 --> 29:46.559
and not let First Madam down.

29:51.920 --> 29:53.400
First Madam, rest assured.

29:53.799 --> 29:55.200
With Yuchan and me here,

29:55.400 --> 29:56.480
we'll make sure Zhichun Hall

29:56.480 --> 29:57.880
is properly taken care of

29:58.000 --> 30:00.160
so Young Master
can be as comfortable as before.

30:04.680 --> 30:06.359
But let me make this clear first.

30:06.968 --> 30:08.720
Young Master
is busy with official duties.

30:09.279 --> 30:10.480
If any of you are unruly

30:10.480 --> 30:11.599
or careless in your work

30:11.880 --> 30:13.440
and cause trouble in Zhichun Hall,

30:14.519 --> 30:16.720
I will not let it slide.

30:29.359 --> 30:30.599
You four stay.

30:31.319 --> 30:33.519
The rest of you follow
Madam Han's arrangements.

30:36.880 --> 30:38.160
You few, come with me.

30:45.920 --> 30:47.119
My name is Yuchan.

30:47.799 --> 30:50.599
I was originally a second-class maid
serving First Madam.

30:51.279 --> 30:53.599
First Madam thought
I handled things reliably,

30:53.759 --> 30:55.240
so she assigned me to Young Master

30:55.559 --> 30:57.359
as the senior maid of Zhichun Hall.

30:58.640 --> 31:01.720
Later, when Young Lady Zhao
managed the household,

31:03.079 --> 31:04.240
she arranged for me to marry

31:04.240 --> 31:06.799
the foolish son of Shopkeeper Liu
from the rice shop.

31:08.119 --> 31:11.279
A few days ago,
Shopkeeper Liu's family was sold off.

31:11.352 --> 31:13.400
I separated from my husband
and left the household,

31:13.680 --> 31:16.000
then begged First Madam
and Young Master for mercy

31:16.088 --> 31:18.216
and was allowed
to return to work at Zhichun Hall.

31:18.599 --> 31:20.079
I'm a few years older than all of you.

31:20.519 --> 31:24.319
From now on,
you can just call me Yuchan.

31:25.519 --> 31:26.720
- Yuchan.
- Yuchan.

31:29.720 --> 31:30.880
On my way here,

31:30.880 --> 31:32.480
Madam Han told me about all of you.

31:33.279 --> 31:35.519
But I still want to hear it
from you yourselves.

31:35.720 --> 31:36.640
What can you do?

31:36.776 --> 31:37.830
What are you capable of?

31:38.200 --> 31:39.519
What do you want to do?

31:49.640 --> 31:52.519
If you've managed to survive
under Young Lady Zhao until now,

31:52.712 --> 31:54.790
each of you must have
your own way of getting by.

31:55.880 --> 31:58.039
Things are different now.

31:58.279 --> 32:01.279
Young Master
is the only master in this courtyard,

32:01.839 --> 32:03.920
and First Madam
is in charge of the household.

32:06.759 --> 32:08.920
You should all go back
and think carefully

32:09.519 --> 32:11.359
about how you want to live from now on.

32:12.759 --> 32:13.960
Once you've figured it out,

32:14.440 --> 32:15.480
come and tell me.

32:16.519 --> 32:17.319
Yuchan,

32:18.200 --> 32:19.400
I'm not very clever.

32:19.519 --> 32:21.200
What if I can't figure it out?

32:22.880 --> 32:24.119
Among the girls in Zhichun Hall

32:24.200 --> 32:26.799
who were sent away by Young Lady Zhao,

32:27.519 --> 32:28.759
I wasn't the only one.

32:29.799 --> 32:32.599
Yet now I'm the only one
who escaped that misery

32:32.799 --> 32:34.480
and managed to return to Zhichun Hall.

32:35.200 --> 32:36.400
Why do you think that is?

32:38.319 --> 32:40.119
Because First Madam and Young Master

32:41.599 --> 32:42.960
think you're capable.

32:50.480 --> 32:51.880
You're all still young,

32:52.504 --> 32:55.080
so you don't yet understand
how hard life is for women,

32:55.720 --> 32:57.279
especially women like us

32:57.720 --> 32:59.400
who serve as maids.

33:00.920 --> 33:03.640
Our lives are even harder
than those of other women.

33:05.920 --> 33:07.559
If you want more choices

33:08.240 --> 33:09.440
and more freedom,

33:10.680 --> 33:11.759
you need to be capable,

33:12.519 --> 33:14.039
to be able to serve your masters well

33:14.480 --> 33:15.799
and earn their regard.

33:16.960 --> 33:17.960
If you're fortunate,

33:18.312 --> 33:20.200
you may not only
receive your master's favor

33:20.200 --> 33:21.400
and regain your indenture,

33:22.039 --> 33:23.720
but also build a life of your own.

33:25.359 --> 33:26.480
Even with average luck,

33:27.000 --> 33:28.640
you can still follow your heart

33:29.480 --> 33:30.640
and choose whom to marry.

33:31.839 --> 33:33.039
And even if you're unlucky,

33:33.960 --> 33:35.200
like me,

33:35.559 --> 33:37.839
and end up suffering
for years after marrying a fool,

33:38.312 --> 33:39.976
you can still receive your master's help

33:40.024 --> 33:42.280
to separate from your husband
and leave his household.

33:46.160 --> 33:47.279
From today onward,

33:48.039 --> 33:49.720
we all belong to Zhichun Hall.

33:50.319 --> 33:51.920
We live under the same roof.

33:52.720 --> 33:54.240
I want a fresh start

33:54.839 --> 33:56.200
and a better life than before.

33:58.799 --> 34:02.480
I hope all of you
can have a better life, too.

34:14.060 --> 34:17.420
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

34:38.920 --> 34:40.519
Baogai and I are all settled in.

34:40.639 --> 34:41.400
What about you?

34:42.079 --> 34:43.280
We're all settled in, too.

34:43.280 --> 34:44.472
We were just about to sleep.

34:53.639 --> 34:54.480
Gantang,

34:54.960 --> 34:56.360
why don't the two of us

34:56.360 --> 34:57.800
go ask Yuchan

34:57.960 --> 35:00.679
to let us switch rooms?

35:02.400 --> 35:03.199
No.

35:03.576 --> 35:05.496
I want to share a room
with Lanxiang, too.

35:13.599 --> 35:14.880
This really feels like a dream.

35:14.952 --> 35:15.920
When we first came here,

35:16.000 --> 35:17.300
I wondered how long it would take

35:17.310 --> 35:19.000
before we could
become second-class maids

35:19.010 --> 35:19.920
like Lucao and Jinzhan.

35:19.920 --> 35:20.639
Xiaolian.

35:23.480 --> 35:25.519
Don't bring up the past again.

35:32.280 --> 35:34.440
I didn't mention it
in front of anyone else.

35:34.880 --> 35:36.639
I'm only talking
about it among ourselves.

35:39.079 --> 35:40.000
You.

35:42.400 --> 35:43.440
Don't mention it again.

35:53.590 --> 35:55.160
Outsiders don't know the details

35:55.272 --> 35:57.432
of Young Master
and Young Madam's separation,

35:57.512 --> 35:58.872
but those of us in this courtyard

35:58.920 --> 36:00.190
all know something wasn't right.

36:00.920 --> 36:03.400
I won't ask what happened
at the Zhao Residence that day.

36:03.559 --> 36:05.719
And none of you
should mention it to anyone,

36:05.880 --> 36:07.304
or you'll only invite trouble.

36:09.440 --> 36:11.079
Gantang is looking out for us.

36:12.199 --> 36:13.000
Xiaolian.

36:13.559 --> 36:15.360
The people and things from the past

36:15.760 --> 36:17.480
are best forgotten completely.

36:19.840 --> 36:20.800
I understand.

36:21.039 --> 36:23.400
Even when it's just us in private,

36:23.400 --> 36:24.519
I won't mention it again.

36:26.199 --> 36:27.039
You.

36:27.039 --> 36:28.519
You may not be very quick-witted,

36:28.519 --> 36:30.159
but at least you listen to advice.

36:31.480 --> 36:32.800
You two are clever.

36:33.599 --> 36:37.119
Tell me what Yuchan meant when she said

36:37.119 --> 36:38.960
the more capable we are,

36:39.079 --> 36:40.400
the more freedom we can earn.

36:44.760 --> 36:48.239
Four third-class maids share one room.

36:48.920 --> 36:51.960
Two second-class maids share one room.

36:52.760 --> 36:55.480
A first-class maid
gets a room to herself.

36:56.280 --> 36:58.920
If the three of us
were still third-class maids,

36:59.079 --> 37:01.199
then four of us
would have to share one room.

37:01.400 --> 37:02.840
Then we definitely couldn't

37:02.840 --> 37:04.119
talk as freely as we do now.

37:04.599 --> 37:07.599
I think that's what freedom means.

37:11.400 --> 37:13.679
Then what does it mean
to be more capable

37:13.800 --> 37:16.480
and have more choices?

37:20.360 --> 37:21.480
Third-class maids

37:22.000 --> 37:23.440
receive five hundred coins a month.

37:23.719 --> 37:24.719
Second-class maids

37:24.720 --> 37:26.180
receive eight hundred coins a month.

37:26.239 --> 37:27.199
First-class maids

37:27.199 --> 37:28.760
receive one tael of silver a month.

37:29.440 --> 37:31.159
When you earn
five hundred coins a month,

37:31.280 --> 37:33.400
you want to send the money home

37:33.440 --> 37:34.984
and can't bear to spend any on candy.

37:35.400 --> 37:37.559
When you earn
one tael of silver a month,

37:37.880 --> 37:39.760
you can still do what you did before

37:39.760 --> 37:41.199
and send five hundred coins home.

37:41.240 --> 37:43.096
Then you'll still
have five hundred coins left.

37:43.440 --> 37:44.800
You can buy candy if you want,

37:44.840 --> 37:46.239
or flowers if you want.

37:46.320 --> 37:47.639
You'll have many more choices.

37:49.400 --> 37:50.440
Exactly.

37:50.440 --> 37:52.728
Back when I was promoted
to second-class maid...

37:56.760 --> 37:57.559
Lanxiang.

37:58.000 --> 37:59.599
Now that Young Madam is gone,

37:59.599 --> 38:01.719
First Madam won't make us
bear children, will she?

38:03.559 --> 38:04.559
Of course not.

38:04.800 --> 38:07.159
Let's just focus on being maids.

38:10.000 --> 38:10.880
Why?

38:12.079 --> 38:12.880
Right.

38:13.800 --> 38:14.599
Why?

38:17.320 --> 38:19.119
A family like the Lin family

38:19.239 --> 38:20.480
cares greatly about propriety.

38:21.639 --> 38:23.840
They would certainly take
a wife before any concubines.

38:24.440 --> 38:26.360
Before, there was a Young Madam,

38:26.880 --> 38:28.519
but she had no children for many years.

38:28.880 --> 38:30.239
Taking concubines or chambermaids

38:30.360 --> 38:31.599
wouldn't have been improper.

38:32.199 --> 38:33.639
Now that Young Madam is gone,

38:34.039 --> 38:37.000
First Madam will surely
wait until things settle down

38:37.039 --> 38:38.719
before finding Young Master a new wife.

38:39.559 --> 38:40.400
Otherwise,

38:40.400 --> 38:42.480
respectable families
who cherish their daughters

38:42.480 --> 38:44.680
would be reluctant
to marry them into this family.

38:50.280 --> 38:51.519
Bodhisattva, please bless us.

38:51.719 --> 38:52.960
That's a relief.

38:53.760 --> 38:54.679
Quick, cover it up.

38:56.639 --> 38:57.880
Then from now on,

38:58.000 --> 39:00.760
I'm going to work hard
to become a first-class maid.

39:01.559 --> 39:03.440
You little monkey
really know how to aim higher.

39:03.679 --> 39:04.599
You once said

39:04.800 --> 39:06.639
you'd be satisfied if you could become

39:06.639 --> 39:07.679
a second-class maid.

39:08.199 --> 39:09.000
And now?

39:09.000 --> 39:11.336
You're actually dreaming
of becoming a first-class maid.

39:12.239 --> 39:14.599
Everyone should hope

39:14.599 --> 39:16.559
that each year
will be better than the last.

39:16.800 --> 39:18.719
Even if that hope never comes true,

39:18.760 --> 39:21.199
it's still nice to dream about it.

39:24.000 --> 39:25.119
It's so cold outside.

39:25.120 --> 39:26.792
I'll sleep here tonight.

39:26.800 --> 39:28.140
The three of us can sleep together.

39:28.150 --> 39:29.920
All right.

39:32.020 --> 39:35.300
(Jinling Ministry of Revenue Office)

39:44.280 --> 39:45.760
Everyone says Lin Fengtai is shrewd.

39:46.440 --> 39:47.719
I think he's a fool.

39:48.280 --> 39:50.039
Young Lady Zhao is beautiful,

39:50.184 --> 39:52.232
and she's
Grand Secretary Zhao's granddaughter.

39:52.679 --> 39:54.239
Yet he would even separate

39:54.400 --> 39:55.320
from a wife like her.

39:55.480 --> 39:57.030
Even if she couldn't bear him children,

39:57.159 --> 39:58.400
he could have taken concubines.

39:58.488 --> 39:59.800
(Dai Rong, Sixth-Rank)
How do you know

39:59.810 --> 40:01.270
Lin Fengtai wanted the separation?

40:01.464 --> 40:04.590
(Registrar, Jinling Ministry of Revenue)
Maybe Young Lady Zhao insisted on it.

40:04.920 --> 40:06.159
That's impossible.

40:06.880 --> 40:08.760
The Lin family
is a prominent Jiangnan family,

40:09.199 --> 40:11.159
and Lin Fengtai
is young and accomplished.

40:11.224 --> 40:12.776
If she remarries after a separation,

40:12.872 --> 40:15.110
she'll never find another man
with such an outstanding

40:15.119 --> 40:16.440
family background and character.

40:16.800 --> 40:18.000
Why is that impossible?

40:19.000 --> 40:22.079
If Young Lady Zhao would rather
separate and remarry,

40:22.920 --> 40:27.480
then Lin Fengtai is most likely
all show and no substance.

40:33.639 --> 40:34.679
Someone!

40:34.679 --> 40:35.440
Congyi.

40:47.159 --> 40:47.960
Lin Fengtai!

40:48.200 --> 40:50.920
How dare you let your subordinate
openly assault an official!

40:51.079 --> 40:51.920
Registrar Dai,

40:52.376 --> 40:53.992
shall we report this to the authorities?

40:58.840 --> 41:01.840
Why would I stoop
to arguing with a rough soldier?

41:02.559 --> 41:03.360
Besides,

41:03.440 --> 41:05.400
Fengtai and I
are both officials of the court.

41:06.039 --> 41:07.280
For your sake, I'll let this go.

41:10.400 --> 41:12.159
What brings you here today, Fengtai?

41:12.159 --> 41:12.760
Come.

41:12.760 --> 41:13.599
Fengtai, please sit.

41:13.760 --> 41:15.620
Quick. Bring
Assistant Commander Lin some tea.

41:15.639 --> 41:16.559
No need for tea.

41:17.320 --> 41:19.119
I'm only here to ask you, Registrar Dai,

41:19.320 --> 41:20.840
with the year-end almost upon us

41:20.880 --> 41:22.119
and the offices about to close,

41:22.519 --> 41:23.760
and after two rounds of snow,

41:24.920 --> 41:26.840
why haven't we seen
any of the padded coats,

41:27.320 --> 41:29.400
combat boots, and fur hats

41:29.832 --> 41:31.800
the Ministry of Revenue promised us?

41:32.039 --> 41:32.880
Could it be that

41:34.920 --> 41:37.400
(Rations)
the rats in this office ate them all?

41:38.110 --> 41:40.296
(Salaries)
The padded coats,

41:40.296 --> 41:41.920
combat boots, and fur hats

41:42.152 --> 41:44.150
were supposed
to have been distributed long ago.

41:44.376 --> 41:46.408
But the Grand Secretariat
just changed the rules.

41:47.159 --> 41:49.400
Winter supplies
for the Garrisons in Jinling

41:49.719 --> 41:51.400
must now be dispatched from Huguang.

41:51.752 --> 41:53.230
As soon as I received the directive,

41:53.240 --> 41:54.540
I urged the local authorities
along the route

41:54.552 --> 41:56.180
to recruit laborers
to haul the supplies.

41:56.190 --> 41:57.384
But with all this heavy snow,

41:57.512 --> 41:59.000
supplying them has been difficult.

41:59.320 --> 42:00.400
Just wait a little longer.

42:02.119 --> 42:03.639
We've already waited a month.

42:04.119 --> 42:05.320
If we wait any longer,

42:06.184 --> 42:08.712
are we supposed to wait
until spring, when the ice melts

42:09.079 --> 42:10.159
and the weather warms up,

42:11.272 --> 42:12.960
before transport is no longer difficult?

42:18.599 --> 42:19.400
Fengtai,

42:19.704 --> 42:21.920
I'm truly not trying
to make things difficult for you.

42:24.159 --> 42:25.360
But I have to say,

42:25.760 --> 42:26.840
my superior

42:27.199 --> 42:28.679
is a disciple of Grand Secretary Zhao.

42:29.719 --> 42:31.239
Usually, you don't even need to ask

42:31.240 --> 42:32.990
for him to give you
priority in everything.

42:34.400 --> 42:36.199
But now that you and Young Lady Zhao...

42:40.960 --> 42:42.400
The rules from above have changed,

42:44.712 --> 42:46.472
and there's nothing I can do about it.

42:48.239 --> 42:48.880
Registrar Dai,

42:52.296 --> 42:55.000
the rough soldiers don't understand
the chain of command.

42:56.320 --> 42:57.400
When we lose our temper,

42:57.960 --> 43:00.079
we only know
how to take matters straight to the top.

43:05.180 --> 43:07.540
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:08.712 --> 43:11.150
- Drop a fortune.
- Drop a fortune.

43:11.159 --> 43:13.159
- Cats come, dogs come.
- Cats come, dogs come.

43:13.159 --> 43:15.159
- The God of Wealth comes to our home.
- The God of Wealth comes to our home.

43:15.159 --> 43:17.079
- Great ingots come rolling in.
- Great ingots come rolling in.

43:17.119 --> 43:19.719
- Little ingots squeeze through the cracks in the door.
- Little ingots squeeze through the cracks in the door.

43:19.760 --> 43:21.000
One, two, three.

43:53.340 --> 43:57.460
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:00.300 --> 44:04.820
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:06.100 --> 44:10.020
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:10.700 --> 44:13.460
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:14.180 --> 44:16.500
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:16.500 --> 44:19.580
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:21.100 --> 44:25.340
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:28.260 --> 44:32.420
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:34.220 --> 44:37.780
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:37.780 --> 44:41.340
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:42.140 --> 44:47.820
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:48.180 --> 44:52.500
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:52.860 --> 44:55.820
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:55.820 --> 44:59.580
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

44:59.580 --> 45:02.460
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:02.460 --> 45:06.540
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

